Python 做法如下——

```Python []
def main(): 
    a, b = map(float, input().split())

    v = 4 * b * b * math.sin(math.pi / 4)

    if a >= v: print(v)
    else:
        theta = math.asin(a / 4 / b / b) / 2
        w = b * math.sin(theta)
        print(w * w / math.tan(math.pi / 8) * 8)
```

